From 17e68d6ade8a1b0fa40ade77d11bfb459409127f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ticky <ticky@dot.local>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 15:44:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] S3 executable end to end: orchestrate() gains input_sha=None
 (its absence raised TypeError on line one of the real path and survived three
 builds because the stage was never run); permanent frame binding installed in
 main() right after S0 and never restored, so none of the 27
 load_sealed_baseline call sites across 22 files can reach the hardcoded
 equiDOT_recon171_step7_* parts, replacing the per-stage override which was
 also not exception-safe; static pre-flight loader audit against a frozen
 allowlist that fails on any new call site; --s3-limit to bound axis units per
 family for smoke-testing; fold-gap recorded on the pool artifact as
 discovery_master.POOL_NOTE.txt because folds_plus/min_fold_pf come from
 sacred calendar-literal wf.FOLDS and exclude July.

---
 dot_master_discovery/master.py                | 95 ++++++++++++++++---
 .../orchestrator/discovery_orchestrator.py    | 35 ++++++-
 2 files changed, 115 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

